in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 2: \"baa\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 3: \"aaa\"  This string is already a palindrome, so we print ; however, , , and  are also all acceptable answers, as the string will still be a palindrome if any one of the characters at those indices are removed.","topics":[],"score":229726,"global_rank":113240,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":19627},{"name":"leozc/zTalkbot","owner":"leozc","html_url":"https://github.com/leozc/zTalkbot","stars":3,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"zTalkbot - gtalk robot on google appengine","topics":[],"score":229723,"global_rank":113245,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":19628},{"name":"FX-Wood/seo-scraper","owner":"FX-Wood","html_url":"https://github.com/FX-Wood/seo-scraper","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Simple scraper module for our hackathon project","topics":[],"score":229723,"global_rank":113248,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":19629},{"name":"hawad416/ai_podcast","owner":"hawad416","html_url":"https://github.com/hawad416/ai_podcast","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"pods : enabling writers and marketing teams to turn their unrefined research, notes and articles into podcasts","topics":[],"score":229723,"global_rank":113253,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":19630},{"name":"bjherger/naive-bayes-classifier","owner":"bjherger","html_url":"https://github.com/bjherger/naive-bayes-classifier","stars":0,"forks":6,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"A simple naive bayes classifier implemented in python. Designed to be robust and quickly implemented.","topics":[],"score":229719,"global_rank":113282,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":19631},{"name":"yasoob/flask-login","owner":"yasoob","html_url":"https://github.com/yasoo